<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Explorers Index slumps in week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Explorers Index slumps in week.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbroker Eyres Reed Ltd said its Australian Explorers Index fell 61.5 points or 1.8 percent in the week to Friday. The All Ordinaries index rose 0.8 percent.</p>
<p>Changes, in percent:</p>
<p>	    Jan 10  Jan 3   pct   1 Month  pct   1 Year  pct</p>
<p>Explorers 3355.7  3417.2 (-1.8) 3264.0 (+2.8)  2348.9 (+42.9) ASX Gold  1720.7  1793.2 (-4.0) 1794.3 (-4.1)  2024.9 (-15.0) All Ords  2418.6  2399.5 (+0.8) 2361.8 (+2.4)  2238.2 (+8.1) Oil &amp; Gas 1616.5  1538.3 (+5.1) 1483.3 (+9.0)  1073.5 (+50.6)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The explorers index (base 500, March 1992) tracks the performance of 88 small capitalisation exploration companies.</p>
</text>
